# Intermediate BNFC outputs. `make -C rzk regen-parser` writes these, feeds them
# to alex/happy to produce the committed Lex.hs/Par.hs, then deletes them; this
# ignore is a safety net in case a regen is interrupted before that cleanup.
# They must not be committed: a build-type: Simple build would otherwise try to
# run alex/happy on them (and fail without those tools).
rzk/src/Language/Rzk/Syntax/Lex.x
rzk/src/Language/Rzk/Syntax/Par.y
